DRAIN STORM v1.0 - Strategy game for Windows
(3.1, 95 or NT; 386+). A very polished,
highly addictive, tactical challenge. Venture
deep into the sewer, pursued by bizarre,
deadly monsters. Gather weapons: Radio-
controlled explosives, decoys, giant bubbles
(which swallow monsters whole) and many more.
Visit Poker Casino to wager weapons, and
battle pit bosses! When you're powerful
enough, attempt the awesome, final challenge.

